        "title": "Production Agent Harness with Human Approval",
        "body_markdown": "# Agent Architecture\n\nA production Agent Harness owns the session, durable task lifecycle, checkpoint, tools, trace, and recovery policy. The Supervisor selects specialist capabilities dynamically, while specialists exchange immutable artifacts instead of hidden prompts.\n\n# Human Decision Flow\n\nHuman-in-the-loop is a durable state transition. The runtime records an interrupt, exposes the available decision options, and resumes the exact checkpoint only after an authorized choice. This keeps topic selection and outline approval explicit without turning the workflow into a fixed prompt chain.\n\nThe final quality gate evaluates retrieval, planning, tool use, evidence support, relevance, and creator style as separate versioned metrics.",
